id: pm-qi7v2j
title: Reuse SDK command admission before offering positional test retries
description: The completed free CodeRabbit re-review of e71cf1ff5 identifies positional command=RESULT=passed and comment-only values receiving executable retries that the SDK immediately refuses. Apply the shared command admission primitive when deriving retry arguments and retain command-required templates with structured metadata instead.
