author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 25
parent: pm-3mefuq
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Validate trimmed structured and bare test-command candidates with assertLinkedTestCommand before offering retryArgs; non-executable candidates receive command-required templates retaining their scope and structured metadata.
expected_result: Offered test retries satisfy the same syntactic admission as registration and never repeat a known assignment/comment-only refusal.
actual_result: "All86 linked regressions pass, including five previously failing recovery controls, real CLI no-write assertions and valid metadata replay. Type, lint, source quality and generated contracts pass. Revised-head hosted checks and renewed review remain merge conditions."
